%p Hello #{@user.full_name},
%p Listed below are the submissions for courses where you are listed as a teacher for the week of: #{@last_week} to #{@today}:

%table
  %thead
    %tr
      %th Submission Date
      %th Course
      %th Programming Lab
      %th Student
      %th Link
  %tbody
    - @submissions.each do |submission|
      %tr
        %td= submission.created_at
        %td= link_to submission.course_title, teacher_course_url(submission.course)
        %td= link_to submission.lab_title, teacher_programming_lab_url(submission.programming_lab)
        %td= submission.author_email
        %td= link_to submission.compose, teacher_course_programming_lab_submission_url(submission.course_programming_lab, submission)
